      "desc": "OpenAI has been going downhill with their business decisions. Tibo on the 24.11.2026 tweeted that paying users will not be able to talk to ChatGPT unlimitedly anymore. So now u cannot have unlimited chats even if you are on the Pro plan. And then later today 25.11.2026, users started getting emails from OpenAI that their usage has been used “less than intended”, and that they will “correct that issue” and make you reach your limit sooner. This image is a meme where Astra, which is drawn as an “anime” girl, holds up an image of this email, and gives it to the user as an early present for Christmas. #fyp #openai #chatgpt #gpt #ai ",
